--- !u!114 &1798691675
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1798691672}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: "Oh, there you are.\nI guess it\u2019s just the three of us. Have you seen
      Spartan Jack around?\r\n"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1798691671}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: "No\u2026 I did think it was a bit strange he was gone yesterday. "
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: "And what we found when he went to his house\u2026 That was just WEIRD.
      He must've known we were onto him--"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1798691671}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: 'Not just us...

      Chrome Dome.

      And Jade too?'
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1073153281}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: This makes NO sense
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "Could it have anything to do with your SECRET that you still haven\u2019t
      told me about?\r\n"
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Confused
  - text: "We should probably.. Y\u2019know\u2026 Tell him. I don\u2019t like covering
      up so much."
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1073153281}
    pose: Sassy
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: " Alright, Thad. Hold on to your hair, because this is one heck of a plot
      reveal\u2026\r\n"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1798691671}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "But all of a sudden\u2026\r\n"
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "Ever since birth, your senses have been superior to all others. Now, with
      the dojoplex silent, you can hear\u2026 Footsteps?"
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: "You hear whispering. \u201CC\u2019mere, Thad. You need to see\u2014\u201C.
      It\u2019s the voice of--\r\n"
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: SPARTAN JACK???
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 6
    face: Surprised
  - text: "Hold on a minute \u2013 I gotta take a quick bathroom break"
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: "Where are you going so fast\u2026 Do you know there\u2019s a bathroom
      RIGHT HERE?"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1073153281}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: "Yeah\u2026 Well\u2026 I\u2019m too manly to be using the ladies\u2019
      room anyway."
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: "Phew. Close one. Good thing you had your MACHO WITS about you. And your
      abs. You never know when you might need to use \u2018em."
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: Time to finally see what Spartan Jack has been up to...
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  turnToFace: 1
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
